  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "はるか　むかしに　うみから　あがってりくちで　くらすようになった。ホエルコに　ちかい　しゅるいらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먼 옛날에 바다에서 올라와 육지에 살게 되었다. 고래왕자의 근연종이라고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "遠古時代自大海上岸後，就開始在陸地上生活。似乎與吼吼鯨是相近的物種。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon a quitté le milieu marin il y a fort longtemps pour s’installer sur la terre ferme. Il appartiendrait à une espèce proche des Wailmer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vor sehr langer Zeit verließ es das Meer, um an Land zu leben. Angeblich ist es eng mit Wailmer verwandt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los miembros de esta especie, emparentada al parecer con los Wailmer, abandonaron hace ya mucho tiempo el mar para vivir en tierra firme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gli esemplari di questa specie, a quanto pare imparentata con i Wailmer, lasciarono il mare in tempi remoti per vivere sulla terraferma.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This species left the ocean and began living on land a very long time ago. It seems to be closely related to Wailmer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "遥か　昔に　海から　上がって陸地で　暮らすようになった。ホエルコに　近い　種類らしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "自远古时代由大海上岸后，就开始在陆地上生活。似乎与吼吼鲸是相近的物种。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los miembros de esta especie, emparentada al parecer con los Wailmer, abandonaron hace ya mucho tiempo el mar para vivir en tierra firme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かんれいちで　５ひきほどの　むれをつくって　くらす。　ゆきや　こおりにふくまれる　ミネラルが　だいすき。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "한랭지에서 5마리 정도가 무리를 이루며 산다. 눈과 얼음에 포함된 미네랄을 좋아한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在寒冷地帶會組成約５隻規模的群體來生活。喜歡雪或冰所含的礦物質。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ces Pokémon vivent généralement en groupes de cinq dans les régions froides. Ils raffolent des minéraux que contiennent la neige et la glace.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In Herden aus circa fünf Artgenossen bewohnt es frostige Gebiete. Am liebsten frisst es Mineralien, die in Schnee und Eis enthalten sind.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Viven en manadas de unos cinco individuos en regiones gélidas. Les encantan los minerales presentes en la nieve y el hielo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive in regioni fredde in branchi di circa cinque esemplari. È ghiotto dei minerali contenuti nella neve e nel ghiaccio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives in frigid regions in pods of five or so individuals. It loves the minerals found in snow and ice.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "寒冷地で　５匹ほどの　群れを作って　暮らす。　雪や　氷に含まれる　ミネラルが　大好き。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在寒冷地带会组成约５只的群体来生活。喜欢雪或冰所包含的矿物质。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
